	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『機動戦士ガンダム 水星の魔女』より、ニカ・ナナウラがFigure-rise Standardシリーズにラインアップ！",
			"• 豊富な表情はタンポ印刷済みパーツ1種と、水転写式デカール用パーツ2種で再現。ニカの様々な表情を演出できるよう、細部まで徹底追求。",
			"• 口の中はパーツ分けにより再現。口開け状態と歯が見えている状態を選択して表現可能。",
			"• ニカの特徴である髪のインナーカラーは、パーツ分けにより再現。",
			"• 制服は新規造形！ポージングの幅が広がる可動域拡張用の制服パーツと軟質の袖パーツが付属。",
			"• 胴体の専用パーツを選択することで自然な座りポーズが表現可能。",
			"• ハンドパーツは全10種が付属。ポーズに合わせて選択できる。",
			"• 付属のタブレットで劇中イメージを再現できる。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"MOBILE SUIT GUNDAM the Witch from Mercury\", Nika Nanaura is in the lineup of the Figure-rise Standard series!",
			"• Abundant expressions are reproduced with one type of tampo printed part and two types of waterslide type decal parts. We thoroughly pursued every detail so that we can produce Nika's various expressions.",
			"• The inside of the mouth is reproduced by dividing it into parts. It is possible to express it by selecting the state in which the mouth is open and the state in which the teeth are visible.",
			"• The inner color of the hair, which is a characteristic of Nika, is reproduced by dividing it into parts.",
			"• Uniforms are newly modeled! Comes with uniform parts for extending the range of motion and soft sleeve parts that expand the range of posing.",
			"• By selecting a special part of the torso, a natural sitting pose can be expressed.",
			"• A total of 10 types of hand parts are included. You can choose according to the pose.",
			"• You can reproduce the image in the play with the attached tablet."
		]
	},
